    Thus 17 applies to (5.3), giving (U) for
  $ A \[ S union j \] subset A \[ S union \( j + 1 \) \] . $
  If $j in S$ or $j$ is inactive, this inclusion is the identity.
    The continuous chain $#scale(x: 120%, y: 120%)[\(] A \[ S union j \]
    #scale(x: 120%, y: 120%)[\)]_(j lt.eq delta)$ starts at $A \[ S \]$ and ends at $X_delta$;
